    {
      "step": 2,
      "name": "串記劇本",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "下班前 conclude 總結案情；不受歡迎的人 exclude 排除在外；提前上鎖叫 preclude。想安靜就 seclude 把自己關起來；管路 occlude 堵塞時全員慌張——有人甚至有 claustrophobia 幽閉恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "name": "詞卡 round",
      "minutes": 7,
      "content": "依 members 逐詞：義錨 → 劇本角色 → 跟讀 speakLineEn／對照 speakLineZh"
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "name": "快測",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "見 quiz（3 題）"
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "name": "口令帶走",
      "minutes": 0.5,
      "content": [
        "關：conclude 結案、exclude 拒入、preclude 預鎖、seclude 自鎖、occlude 堵塞",
        "preclude ≈ prevent by making impossible"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "quiz": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "sense",
      "promptEn": "To make something impossible in advance is to:",
      "promptZh": "預先使某事不可能發生，是：",
      "choices": [
        "include",
        "preclude",
        "seclude",
        "conclude"
      ],
      "answer": "preclude"
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "sense",
      "promptEn": "To shut oneself away from others is to:",
      "promptZh": "使自己與他人隔絕，是：",
      "choices": [
        "exclude",
        "seclude",
        "occlude",
        "conclude"
      ],
      "answer": "seclude"
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "lookalike",
      "promptEn": "preclude is NOT the same as:",
      "promptZh": "preclude 不等于：",
      "choices": [
        "prevent by ruling out",
        "make impossible",
        "include beforehand",
        "forestall"
      ],
      "answer": "include beforehand"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "include 的反義常想到 exclude；preclude 不是『預先包括』",
    "conclude 雙義：結束／得出結論"
  ],
